      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The text can be translated into a logical statement about when the amendment applies.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The applicability clause can be expressed as: Gifts made after Division 1A and 3A of Part 15 of the Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999 and Part 5 of the Australian Heritage Council Act 2003 commence."
    },
    {
