    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 References to the Australian Heritage Commission",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003#sch-2-sec-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAfter this Schedule commences, a reference in an instrument to the\nAustralian Heritage Commission is taken to be a reference to the\nCommonwealth.\n(2)\nThis item does not modify any register kept by a land registration\nofficial under a law of a State or Territory.\n(3)\nIn this item:\ninstrument includes a will or other testamentary instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nAfter this Schedule commences, a reference in an instrument to the\nAustralian Heritage Commission is taken to be a reference to the\nCommonwealth.\n(2)\nThis item does not modify any register kept by a land registration\nofficial under a law of a State or Territory.\n(3)\nIn this item:\ninstrument includes a will or other testamentary instrument.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9b0ea78ddaeef179ad32a9f2468e983185612253200d10cdba810085bcdd62be",
      "skos:note": "Reference to Australian Heritage Commission is taken to be a reference to the Commonwealth after commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003#sch-2-sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 References to the Australian Heritage Commission",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAfter this Schedule commences, a reference in an instrument to the\nAustralian Heritage Commission is taken to be a reference to the\nCommonwealth.\n(2)\nThis item does not modify any register kept by a land registration\nofficial under a law of a State or Territory.\n(3)\nIn this item:\ninstrument includes a will or other testamentary instrument."
    },
    {
