        "@id": "australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any right, title or interest in particular land vests in the\nCommonwealth under item 3; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with a land registration official a certificate\nthat:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\n\n2003            7\n\n(ii) identifies the land; and\n\n(iii) states that the right, title or interest has become vested\nin the Commonwealth under item 3.\n(2)\nThe land registration official may:\n\n(a) register the matter in a way that is the same as, or similar to,\nthe way in which dealings in land of that kind are registered;\nand\n\n(b) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate.\n(3)\nA document that appears to be a certificate under subitem (1) is to be\ntaken to be such a certificate, and to have been properly given, unless\nthe contrary is established.\n(4)\nIn this item:\nland registration official, in relation to land, means the Registrar of\nTitles or other proper officer of the State or Territory in which the land\nis situated.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any right, title or interest in particular land vests in the\nCommonwealth under item 3; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with a land registration official a certificate\nthat:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\n\n2003            7\n\n(ii) identifies the land; and\n\n(iii) states that the right, title or interest has become vested\nin the Commonwealth under item 3.\n(2)\nThe land registration official may:\n\n(a) register the matter in a way that is the same as, or similar to,\nthe way in which dealings in land of that kind are registered;\nand\n\n(b) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate.\n(3)\nA document that appears to be a certificate under subitem (1) is to be\ntaken to be such a certificate, and to have been properly given, unless\nthe contrary is established.\n(4)\nIn this item:\nland registration official, in relation to land, means the Registrar of\nTitles or other proper officer of the State or Territory in which the land\nis situated.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-4-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ccc46a3f4f1fe1631c24dadc1446e5fa158627ec77214e3a61d8030879ad2096",
      "skos:note": "Registration of transfers of land"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003#sch-2-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Registration of transfers of land",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) any right, title or interest in particular land vests in the\nCommonwealth under item 3; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with a land registration official a certificate\nthat:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\nTransitional provisions  Schedule 2\n\n2003            7\n\n(ii) identifies the land; and\n\n(iii) states that the right, title or interest has become vested\nin the Commonwealth under item 3.\n(2)\nThe land registration official may:\n\n(a) register the matter in a way that is the same as, or similar to,\nthe way in which dealings in land of that kind are registered;\nand\n\n(b) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate.\n(3)\nA document that appears to be a certificate under subitem (1) is to be\ntaken to be such a certificate, and to have been properly given, unless\nthe contrary is established.\n(4)\nIn this item:\nland registration official, in relation to land, means the Registrar of\nTitles or other proper officer of the State or Territory in which the land\nis situated."
    },
