      "cml:conclusionText": "...deal with, and give effect to, the certificate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Certificates concerning assets other than land",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003#sch-2-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) an asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under\nitem 3; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the asset; and\n\n(iii) states that the asset has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under item 3.\n(2)\nThe assets official may:\n\n(a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a\nproper and appropriate instrument for transactions\nconcerning assets of that kind; and\n\n(b) make such entries in the register as are necessary having\nregard to the effect of this Schedule.\n(3)\nA document that appears to be a certificate under subitem (1) is to be\ntaken to be such a certificate, and to have been properly given, unless\nthe contrary is established.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) an asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under\nitem 3; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the asset; and\n\n(iii) states that the asset has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under item 3.\n(2)\nThe assets official may:\n\n(a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a\nproper and appropriate instrument for transactions\nconcerning assets of that kind; and\n\n(b) make such entries in the register as are necessary having\nregard to the effect of this Schedule.\n(3)\nA document that appears to be a certificate under subitem (1) is to be\ntaken to be such a certificate, and to have been properly given, unless\nthe contrary is established.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003-sch-2-sec-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5b0e4fc365ddb62d663fc23f3a7f65668f24ec32aee58ef894e7e4bffcfe3149",
      "skos:note": "Certificate requirements for assets other than land"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-council-consequential-and-transitional-provisions-act-2003#sch-2-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Certificates concerning assets other than land",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if:\n\n(a) an asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under\nitem 3; and\n\n(b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:\n\n(i) is signed by the Minister; and\n\n(ii) identifies the asset; and\n\n(iii) states that the asset has become vested in the\nCommonwealth under item 3.\n(2)\nThe assets official may:\n\n(a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a\nproper and appropriate instrument for transactions\nconcerning assets of that kind; and\n\n(b) make such entries in the register as are necessary having\nregard to the effect of this Schedule.\n(3)\nA document that appears to be a certificate under subitem (1) is to be\ntaken to be such a certificate, and to have been properly given, unless\nthe contrary is established.\n\nSchedule 2  Transitional provisions"
    },
